OL,3,GNEWSAOne way system to address town's
OL,4,Atraffic problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thin, winding road which leads
OL,7,Fthrough a market town could be made
OL,8,Fsafer under new plans to create a one
OL,9,Fway system.
OL,11,FWhen large vehicles pass through Silver
OL,12,FStreet in Bradford on Avon, Wiltshire,
OL,13,Fthey sometimes mount the pavement and
OL,14,Fscrape walls as they try to avoid
OL,15,Foncoming traffic.
OL,17,FThe town council has backed a Wiltshire
OL,18,FCouncil plan to implement a temporary
OL,19,Fuphill one-way system on part of Silver
OL,20,FStreet between 07:00 - 19:00 BST to
OL,21,Fimprove the situation.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
