OL,3,GNEWSAOne way system to address town's
OL,4,Atraffic problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FKlas Hyllen, who lives on the road,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We have a low bollard to protect
OL,8,Fthe corner of our house, but very often
OL,9,Flarger vehicles strike it and [the
OL,10,Fnoise] rattles through the whole house.
OL,11,FThere are a few cracks in the floor."
